# Personal secret paths for the bsb-code-guards Bash hook — one ERE per line.
# Any Claude Bash command whose text matches is blocked. Team-wide patterns (.env, credentials,
# SSH keys, the op CLI) live in the plugin itself; this file is for Fraser's own layout.
# yadm-tracked, so Dixie and OnoSendai share it.

# Bunsen: Google OAuth client + tokens, Anthropic key
\.config/bunsen/google
\.config/bunsen/anthropic\.key
# Nucleus staging confs carry site keys (the bin/ wrappers stay runnable)
\.config/nucleus/[^/[:space:]]*\.conf
# Local's GraphQL API token
graphql-connection-info\.json
# Claude Code's own config holds MCP API keys (e.g. Todoist) and the login token
\.claude\.json
\.claude/\.credentials\.json
